### Admin auth me should work with current token
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin account patients should remain lightweight by default
GET http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/patients?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin account providers should remain lightweight by default
GET http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/providers?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Refresh access token using refresh cookie
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken={{refresh_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
